|  What would such a radical change involve? Essentially it would require a rethinking of all the basic elements of the family courts and their
|  auxiliaries - the rebirth of the entire system. That is, certain fundamental beliefs held by family court judges and their cadre of auxiliaries must
|  be drastically revised. We examine some of these fundamental concepts
.  next

